From 356886e8c5ee640c00b4623f4e0912f6f731de08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antony Vo <antonyvo@mail.grokbot.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:07:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat: support AI SDK 7 and zod 4, forward abortSignal, typed
 errors

Stacked on #21. peerDependencies ai ^6 || ^7 and zod ^3.25.76 || ^4.1.8; abortSignal forwarded to fetch, pre-aborted calls make no request, AbortError rethrown unchanged (fixes #22); ExaApiError with status/tag/requestId/retryAfterSeconds; optional config.fetch; deprecated livecrawl no longer sent by default; livecrawl + maxAgeHours rejected up front. Adds tests against the real API and an ai@6/7 x zod@3/4 install matrix (see test/compat/run.mjs).
